**What changed (server/core, additive, standard `calendarEvent` only):**
- Pure `resolveCalendarEventVisibility` (SHARE → owned → METADATA → local creator FULL/others REDACTED → HIDDEN) + 7 unit cases; wired into the findMany/findOne visibility service (now resolves the creator actor and hoists channel ownership) and the timeline service (owner-full for channel-less events). `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-server/src/modules/calendar/common/utils/resolve-calendar-event-visibility.util.ts:9`
